  "pc_requirements": {
    "minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统 *:</strong> 64-bit Windows Vista<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Core i3 / AMD A6 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 260 / AMD Radeon HD 5750. OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 25 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Integrated Intel graphics are not supported. They should work (Intel HD 4000-series or better), but with issues.</li></ul>",
    "recommended": "<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统 *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Core i5 / AMD FX 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 480 / AMD Radeon HD 5970. OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 25 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Integrated Intel graphics are not supported. They should work (Intel HD 4000-series or better), but with issues.</li></ul>"
